<title>HONG KONG: ABC interim profit edges up 7.9 percent.</title>
<headline>ABC interim profit edges up 7.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   14.22  vs  13.18</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0    vs  2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  5.79 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    56.89  vs  52.71</p>
<p>    Turnover		     171.67 vs  172.09 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Company name		 ABC Communications (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 6-8</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 15</p>
<p>NOTE - ABC Communications is a paging operator.</p>
<p>Turnover for 1995 has been adjusted down by HK$5.42 million to conform to accounting treatment. The discrepancy arises as net pager sales after discount are taken as turnover for 1996 while gross pager sales before discount were taken for 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
